2 Getting Started
*****************

2.1 Installation
================

Copy ‘apt-man.sh’ to a directory in your PATH:

     sudo cp apt-man.sh /usr/local/bin/apt-man
     sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/apt-man

2.2 Basic Usage
===============

List all sources:
     apt-man list

   List sources with their signing keys:
     apt-man list --keys

   Run comprehensive security audit:
     apt-man lint

   Check for key problems:
     apt-man keys --check


